-hire rate jumps from 61% to 88% within two quarters.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wf-timeline__item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"wf-timeline__year\\\">2023<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h4>Escrow and milestones go live<\\/h4>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Payment protection becomes standard on every engagement. Average time-to-payment for freelancers falls from 34 days to 6.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wf-timeline__item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"wf-timeline__year\\\">2026<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h4>Fourteen countries, one standard<\\/h4>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>12,400 vetted specialists across six disciplines, and a 96% rate of clients who come back for a second engagement.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[]}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"fc93a3c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"96\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"96\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"72\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"72\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"56\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"56\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"css_classes\":\"wf-about-team\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4ef968f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"boxed\",\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1180},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"colu