\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"boxed\",\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1180},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"column\":\"40\",\"row\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"970936c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"max_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":820},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"css_classes\":\"wf-legal\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c2c319f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><em>Last updated 18 September 2026. This policy applies to workfoster.com and to the services delivered through it.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>1. Who we are<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Workfoster Technologies Private Limited (&ldquo;Workfoster&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;) is the data controller for the personal data described in this policy. Our registered office is 4th Floor, Prestige Sigma, 3 Vittal Mallya Road, Bengaluru 560001, India. You can reach our data protection contact at <a href=\\\"mailto:privacy@workfoster.com\\\">privacy@workfoster.com<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>2. What we collect<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>We collect only what we need to match people to work and to run the contract that follows.<\\/p>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><strong>Identity and contact data<\\/strong> \\u2014 name, email address, phone number, and the country you work from.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><strong>Professional data<\\/strong> \\u2014 your CV, portfolio links, rate expectations, availability and references.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><strong>Engagement data<\\/strong> \\u2014 briefs, milestones, messages exchanged on the platform and reviews left at the end.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><strong>Payment data<\\/strong> \\u2014 bank or payout details, held by our regulated payment partner rather than by us.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li><strong>Technical data<\\/strong> \\u2014 IP address, browser type and pages visited, collected through first-party analytics.<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t<h2>3. Why we process it<\\/h2>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li>To match specialists to briefs and present shortlists to clients \\u2014 on the basis of legitimate interest, and consent where you submit an application.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>To create and perform the contract for an engagement, including escrow and payouts.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>To meet legal and tax obligations in the jurisdictions we operate in.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>To improve the service, using aggregated data that does not identify an individual.<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t<h2>4. Who we share it with<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Your profile is shared with a client only when you have applied to their brief, or when you have told us we may put you forward. We also use processors for hosting, email delivery, analytics and payments. Each is bound by a data processing agreement, and none may use your data for their own purposes. We never sell personal data.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>5. How long we keep it<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Applications that do not lead to an engagement are kept for 18 months, then deleted. Engagement records are kept for eight years to meet tax and contractual obligations. You can ask us to delete an unsuccessful application sooner, and we will.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>6. Your rights<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>You have the right to access, correct, delete, restrict and port your personal data, and to object to processing carried out on the basis of legitimate interest. Write to <a href=\\\"mailto:privacy@workfoster.com\\\">privacy@workfoster.com<\\/a> and we will respond within 30 days. If you are in the EEA or UK and are unhappy with our response, you may complain to your local supervisory authority.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>7. Cookies<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>We use strictly necessary cookies to keep you signed in and to remember form progress. Analytics cookies are set only after you accept them, and you can withdraw that at any time from the cookie banner.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>8. International transfers<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Some of our processors are outside India and the EEA. Where that is the case we rely on Standard Contractual Clauses and, where required, a transfer impact assessment.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>9. Changes to this policy<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>We will post any material change on this page and, where the change affects an active engagement, email the people it affects at least 14 days before it takes effect.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16.5},\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.75},\"text_color\":\"#47584F\"},\"elements\":[]}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(184,27,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(185,27,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(186,27,'_elementor_version','4.2.4'),(187,27,'_wp_page_template','elementor_header_footer'),(188,27,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"5fa5aaf\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"76\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"52\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"54\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_background\":\"gradient\",\"background_color\":\"#07301F\",\"background_color_b\":\"#0F7A4D\",\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":145},\"css_classes\":\"wf-banner\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f3e0824\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"boxed\",\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1180},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"column\":\"14\",\"row\":\"14\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2e2de83\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"html\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"wf-crumbs\\\"><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/workfoster\\/\\\">Home<\\/a><span>\\/<\\/span>Terms of Use<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[]},{\"id\":\"1a4ba2e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"heading\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Terms of Use\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":46},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":38},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30},\"typography_font_weight\":\"800\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.15},\"typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":-1.2}},\"elements\":[]},{\"id\":\"abc87f9\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"max_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":680},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2f9b6fd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>The rules that apply when you use the Workfoster platform, as a client or as a specialist.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":17.5},\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.75},\"text_color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.80)\"},\"elements\":[]}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"ec21e60\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"96\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"96\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"72\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"72\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"56\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"56\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"css_classes\":\"wf-legal-page\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"129a5cc\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"boxed\",\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1180},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"column\":\"40\",\"row\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4042a58\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"max_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":820},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"css_classes\":\"wf-legal\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bce5072\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><em>Last updated 18 September 2026. By using workfoster.com you agree to these terms.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>1. The service<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Workfoster is a managed marketplace. We introduce clients to independent specialists, provide the contract framework for the engagement, and hold payment in escrow until milestones are accepted. We are not the employer of any specialist on the platform, and we are not a party to the work itself.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>2. Accounts<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>You must give accurate information when you create an account and keep it current. You are responsible for activity under your credentials. Accounts may not be shared, sold or transferred.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>3. For clients<\\/h2>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li>Briefs must describe real, lawful work with a genuine budget.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>The platform fee is a flat 8% of engagement value, shown before you commit.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Milestone funds must be placed in escrow before work begins.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>A milestone must be accepted or rejected with reasons within five working days of delivery.<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t<h2>4. For specialists<\\/h2>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li>You confirm you are able to work as an independent contractor in your jurisdiction and are responsible for your own taxes.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Profiles, portfolios and references must be your own and accurate.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>The platform fee is a flat 8%, deducted at payout.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Work delivered must be original or properly licensed, and free of undisclosed third-party material.<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\n\\t<h2>5. Intellectual property<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Unless the engagement contract says otherwise, all IP in delivered work transfers to the client on acceptance and payment of the relevant milestone. Until then it remains with the specialist. Workfoster claims no ownership over work delivered through the platform.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>6. Payments and disputes<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Escrow is held by our regulated payment partner. If a milestone is disputed, either party may raise it within five working days and Workfoster will mediate. Where mediation fails, funds are released according to the evidence of work delivered. Our decision is final for amounts under \\u20b95,00,000.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>7. Prohibited use<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>You may not use the platform to post discriminatory listings, to solicit unpaid work, to circumvent escrow on an active engagement, to scrape data, or to misrepresent identity or experience. We may suspend accounts that do.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>8. Liability<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Workfoster is liable for the platform and the escrow service. We are not liable for the quality, legality or timeliness of work performed by a specialist, though we will act on our replacement guarantee. Our aggregate liability is limited to the fees we received for the engagement in question.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>9. Termination<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>Either party may close an account at any time. Active engagements continue under their own contract terms until complete or terminated under those terms.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<h2>10. Governing law<\\/h2>\\n\\t<p>These terms are governed by the laws of India, and the courts of Bengaluru have exclusive jurisdiction.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16.5},\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.75},\"text_color\":\"#47584F\"},\"elements\":[]}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(325,46,'ehf_template_type','type_header'),(326,46,'ehf_target_include_locations','a:2:{s:4:\"rule\";a:1:{i:0;s:12:\"basic-global\";}s:8:\"specific\";a:0:{}}'),(327,46,'ehf_target_exclude_locations','a:2:{s:4:\"rule\";a:0:{}s:8:\"specific\";a:0:{}}'),(328,46,'ehf_target_user_roles','a:1:{i:0;s:3:\"all\";}'),(329,46,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(330,46,'_elementor_template_type','type_header'),(331,46,'_elementor_version','4.2.4'),(333,46,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"1c11601\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"14\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"14\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"border_color\":\"#E2EAE5\",\"css_classes\":\"wf-header\",\"position\":\"sticky\",\"sticky\":\"top\",\"sticky_on\":[\"desktop\",\"table