nce check replaces gut feel. Repeat-hire rate jumps from 61% to 88% within two quarters.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wf-timeline__item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"wf-timeline__year\\\">2023<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h4>Escrow and milestones go live<\\/h4>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Payment protection becomes standard on every engagement. Average time-to-payment for freelancers falls from 34 days to 6.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"wf-timeline__item\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"wf-timeline__year\\\">2026<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h4>Fourteen countries, one standard<\\/h4>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>12,400 vetted specialists across six disciplines, and a 96% rate of clients who come back for a second engagement.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-fc93a3c e-con-full wf-about-team e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"fc93a3c\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\" data-settings=\\\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\\\">\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ef968f e-con-boxed e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"4ef968f\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"e-con-inner\\\">\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e9098e e-con-full wf-section-head is-center e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"7e9098e\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-4438d5a elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\\\" data-id=\\\"4438d5a\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widge