					Support that answers						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						A real account manager, reachable on a working day, who knows your project by name.					</p>\n							<p>Client stories</p>					<h2>What people say after the project ships</h2>		<p>Reviews are collected after final delivery and published unedited — the mixed ones too.</p>					\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i>				Rated 5 out of 5\n				<p>“We had been burned twice before. Workfoster sent three people, all three were credible, and the one we picked rebuilt our forecasting model in six weeks. The paid discovery week is what sold me — it de-risks the whole thing.”</p>			\n						AR\n							<strong>Anita Rao</strong>\n							<small>Head of Supply Chain, Northwind</small>\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i>				Rated 5 out of 5\n				<p>&ldquo;As a freelancer the difference is getting paid without chasing anyone. Milestones are agreed up front, the money is already in escrow, and the account manager actually replies. I have stopped pitching anywhere else.&rdquo;</p>			\n						MK\n							<strong>Marcus Kern</strong>\n							<small>Independent Product Designer</small>\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i>				Rated 5 out of 5\n				<p>&ldquo;Not everything was perfect — our first match was not the right fit and we said so. They replaced the specialist within four days at no extra cost. That is the part I would tell other CFOs about.&rdquo;</p>			\n						SD\n							<strong>Sneha Desai</strong>\n							<small>CFO, Harbourline Capital</small>\n										<h2>Join us — whichever side of the brief you are on</h2>		<p>Post a brief and get a matched shortlist in 48 hours, or create a freelancer profile and start applying to work that matches what you actually do.</p>								<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/contact-us/\">\n									Post a brief\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/\">\n									Join as a freelancer\n					</a>\n									<p>Free to post &middot; No credit card &middot; Flat 8% platform fee</p>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','20-revision-v1','','','2026-09-18 15:46:07','2026-09-18 10:16:07','',20,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/?p=165',0,'revision','',0),(166,1,'2026-09-18 15:46:20','2026-09-18 10:16:20','<p>Trusted by 1,200+ teams across 14 countries</p>					<h1>Where expert talent meets work worth doing</h1>		<p>At Workfoster we bridge the gap between opportunity and talent. Our expert-driven solutions help organisations streamline operations and scale effortlessly — with transparency, accountability and long-term success built in.</p>								<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/contact-us/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									Hire an Expert\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/\">\n									Join as a Freelancer\n					</a>\n				AR\n				MK\n				SD\n				NP\n				+9k\n			<p><strong>4.8 / 5</strong> average rating from 2,340 completed engagements</p>\n			<article>\n				<header>\n					NA\n						<h3>Senior Data Scientist</h3>\n						<p>Northwind Analytics &middot; Remote</p>\n					Featured\n				</header>\n				<ul>\n					<li>Python</li><li>Forecasting</li><li>SQL</li>\n				</ul>\n				<footer>\n					&#8377;1,600 &ndash; &#8377;2,200 <small>/ hour</small>\n					View role\n				</footer>\n			</article>\n				Matched in 41 hours\n				<strong>Milestone released</strong>\n				&#8377;84,000 &middot; escrow\n				[wf_career_search label=\"Search jobs\"]			<p>Popular right now:\n								<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/?wf_cat=data-science\">Data Science</a>\n								<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/?wf_cat=web-development\">Web Development</a>\n								<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/?wf_cat=writing\">Writing</a>\n								<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/?wf_cat=finance\">Finance</a>\n							</p>							\n			Vetted experts on the platform			\n				0\n				+\n			Projects delivered since 2019			\n				0\n				+\n			Clients who hire a second time			\n				0\n				%\n			Median time to first shortlist			\n				0\n				h\n							<p>Browse by skill</p>					<h2>Popular categories</h2>		<p>Six disciplines make up most of what our clients hire for. Every specialist in them has been interviewed and reference-checked before they appear in a shortlist.</p>[wf_categories limit=\"6\" columns=\"3\"]			<p>Live briefs</p>					<h2>Top freelancing opportunities</h2>		<p>Hand-picked engagements open for applications this week.</p>								<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									View all opportunities\n					</a>\n						[wf_careers featured=\"yes\" count=\"6\" columns=\"3\" filters=\"no\" search=\"no\"]			<p>How it works</p>					<h2>Four steps from brief to delivery</h2>		<p>No bidding wars, no ghosting. A short, structured p