time			\n				0\n				%\n			Median time to first shortlist			\n				0\n				h\n							<p>Browse by skill</p>					<h2>Popular categories</h2>		<p>Six disciplines make up most of what our clients hire for. Every specialist in them has been interviewed and reference-checked before they appear in a shortlist.</p>[wf_categories limit=\"6\" columns=\"3\"]			<p>Live briefs</p>					<h2>Top freelancing opportunities</h2>		<p>Hand-picked engagements open for applications this week.</p>								<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									View all opportunities\n					</a>\n						[wf_careers featured=\"yes\" count=\"6\" columns=\"3\" filters=\"no\" search=\"no\"]			<p>How it works</p>					<h2>Four steps from brief to delivery</h2>		<p>No bidding wars, no ghosting. A short, structured process that respects everybody&rsquo;s time.</p>			01							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M218.17 424.14c-2.95-5.92-8.09-6.52-10.17-6.52s-7.22.59-10.02 6.19l-7.67 15.34c-6.37 12.78-25.03 11.37-29.48-2.09L144 386.59l-10.61 31.88c-5.89 17.66-22.38 29.53-41 29.53H80c-8.84 0-16-7.16-16-16s7.16-16 16-16h12.39c4.83 0 9.11-3.08 10.64-7.66l18.19-54.64c3.3-9.81 12.44-16.41 22.78-16.41s19.48 6.59 22.77 16.41l13.88 41.64c19.75-16.19 54.06-9.7 66 14.16 1.89 3.78 5.49 5.95 9.36 6.26v-82.12l128-127.09V160H248c-13.2 0-24-10.8-24-24V0H24C10.7 0 0 10.7 0 24v464c0 13.3 10.7 24 24 24h336c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24v-40l-128-.11c-16.12-.31-30.58-9.28-37.83-23.75zM384 121.9c0-6.3-2.5-12.4-7-16.9L279.1 7c-4.5-4.5-10.6-7-17-7H256v128h128v-6.1zm-96 225.06V416h68.99l161.68-16