\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Every specialist interviewed and reference-checked by a human\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Flat 8% platform fee — no bidding credits, no paywalls\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Milestone escrow on every engagement, both sides protected\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										A named account manager from brief to final invoice\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n												<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/about-us/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									More about us\n					</a>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M296 160H180.6l42.6-129.8C227.2 15 215.7 0 200 0H56C44 0 33.8 8.9 32.2 20.8l-32 240C-1.7 275.2 9.5 288 24 288h118.7L96.6 482.5c-3.6 15.2 8 29.5 23.3 29.5 8.4 0 16.4-4.4 20.8-12l176-304c9.3-15.9-2.2-36-20.7-36z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Fast, honest matching						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						A shortlist in 48 hours, or we tell you the brief is not realistic at that budget.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 336h-.02c0-16.18 1.34-8.73-85.05-181.51-17.65-35.29-68.19-35.36-85.87 0C-2.06 328.75.02 320.33.02 336H0c0 44.18 57.31 80 128 80s128-35.82 128-80zM128 176l72 144H56l72-144zm511.98 160c0-16.18 1.34-8.73-85.05-181.51-17.65-35.29-68.19-35.36-85.87 0-87.12 174.26-85.04 165.84-85.04 181.51H384c0 44.18 57.31 80 128 80s128-35.82 128-80h-.02zM440 320l72-144 72 144H440zm88 128H352V153.25c23.51-10.29 41.16-31.48 46.39-57.25H528c8.84 0 16-7.16 16-16V48c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16H383.64C369.04 12.68 346.09 0 320 0s-49.04 12.68-63.64 32H112c-8.84 0-16 7.16-16 16v32c0 8.84 7.16 16 16 16h129.61c5.23 25.76 22.87 46.96 46.39 57.25V448H112c-8.84 0-16 7.16-16 16v32c0 8.84 7.16 16 16 16h416c8.84 0 16-7.16 16-16v-32c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Transparent pricing						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						One flat fee, shown up front. What the client pays and what the expert earns are both visible.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 224h-24v-72C376 68.2 307.8 0 224 0S72 68.2 72 152v72H48c-26.5 0-48 21.5-48 48v192c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V272c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48zm-104 0H152v-72c0-39.7 32.3-72 72-72s72 32.3 72 72v72z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Escrow on every milestone						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Money is committed before work starts and released when the milestone is accepted.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M192 208c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-16c-35.35 0-64 28.65-64 64v48c0 35.35 28.65 64 64 64h16c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V208zm176 144c35.35 0 64-28.65 64-64v-48c0-35.35-28.65-64-64-64h-16c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v112c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h16zM256 0C113.18 0 4.58 118.83 0 256v16c0 8.84 7.16 16 16 16h16c8.84 0 16-7.16 16-16v-16c0-114.69 93.31-208 208-208s208 93.31 208 208h-.12c.08 2.43.12 165.72.12 165.72 0 23.35-18.93 42.28-42.28 42.28H320c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48h-32c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48s21.49 48 48 48h181.72c49.86 0 90.28-40.42 90.28-90.28V256C507.42 118.83 398.82 0 256 0z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Support that answers						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						A real account manager, reachable on a working day, who knows your project by name.					</p>\n							<p>Client stories</p>					<h2>What people say after the project ships</h2>		<p>Reviews are collected after final delivery and published unedited — the mixed ones too.</p>					\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i>				Rated 5 out of 5\n				<p>“We had been burned twice before. Workfoster sent three people, all three were credible, and the one we picked rebuilt our forecasting model in six weeks. The paid discovery week is what sold me — it de-risks the whole thing.”</p>			\n						AR\n							<strong>Anita Rao</strong>\n							<small>Head of Supply Chain, Northwind</small>\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i>				Rated 5 out of 5\n				<p>&ldquo;As a freelancer the difference is getting paid without chasing anyone. Milestones are agreed up front, the money is already in escrow, and the account manager actually replies. I have stopped pitching anywhere else.&rdquo;</p>			\n						MK\n							<strong>Marcus Kern</strong>\n							<small>Independent Product Designer</small>\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#xE934;</i>				Rated 5 out of 5\n				<p>&ldquo;Not everything was perfect — our first match was not the right fit and we said so. They replaced the specialist within four days at no extra cost. That is the part I would tell other CFOs about.&rdquo;</p>			\n						SD\n							<strong>Sneha Desai</strong>\n							<small>CFO, Harbourline Capital</small>\n										<h2>Join us — whichever side of the brief you are on</h2>		<p>Post a brief and get a matched shortlist in 48 hours, or create a freelancer profile and start applying to work that matches what you actually do.</p>								<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/contact-us/\">\n									Post a brief\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/\">\n									Join as a freelancer\n					</a>\n									<p>Free to post &middot; No credit card &middot; Flat 8% platform fee</p>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','20-revision-v1','','','2026-09-18 15:46:21','2026-09-18 10:16:21','',20,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/?p=168',0,'revision','',0),(169,1,'2026-09-18 15:46:45','2026-09-18 10:16:45','{\"version\": 3, \"isGlobalStylesUserThemeJSON\": true }','Custom Styles','','publish','closed','closed','','wp-global-styles-hello-elementor-child','','','2026-09-18 15:46:45','2026-09-18 10:16:45','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/wp-global-styles-hello-elementor-child/',0,'wp_global_styles','',0),(170,1,'2026-09-18 15:50:24','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Auto Draft','','auto-draft','closed','closed','','','','','2026-09-18 15:50:24','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/?p=170',0,'post','',0),(171,1,'2026-09-16 07:19:41','2026-09-16 01:49:41','<p>Northwind Analytics builds the demand planning stack for one of India\'s largest grocery retailers. Their forecasting models drive replenishment across 900+ stores, and they are looking for a senior practitioner to take ownership of the model lifecycle end to end.</p><h2>What you will be doing</h2><ul><li>Design, train and validate hierarchical demand forecasting models across SKU, store and region levels.</li><li>Work with the data engineering team to productionise pipelines in Airflow and monitor drift after release.</li><li>Translate forecast error into commercial language the planning team can act on.</li><li>Run fortnightly model reviews with the client\'s supply chain leads.</li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul><li>Five or more years applying statistical and ML forecasting in a commercial setting.</li><li>Strong Python (Pandas, Scikit-learn, statsmodels) and production-grade SQL.</li><li>Experience with intermittent demand and long-tail SKUs — not just clean time series.</li><li>Comfortable presenting to non-technical stakeholders.</li></ul><h3>Nice to have</h3><ul><li>Exposure to retail or FMCG supply chains.</li><li>Familiarity with Databricks or Snowflake.</li></ul><h2>How we work</h2><p>Workfoster handles the contract, the milestones and the payment schedule, so you deal with one point of contact instead of chasing invoices. Every engagement starts with a paid, scoped discovery week before the full commitment is confirmed.</p>','Senior Data Scientist — Demand Forecasting','Own the forecasting models behind a national grocery chain\'s replenishment engine, from feature design through to production monitoring.','publish','closed','closed','','senior-data-scientist-demand-forecasting','','','2026-09-16 07:19:41','2026-09-16 01:49:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/senior-data-scientist-demand-forecasting/',-1,'job_listing','',0),(172,1,'2026-09-13 07:19:41','2026-09-13 01:49:41','<p>Lakeforge has forty-odd Excel reports doing the job of a reporting layer. This engagement is about replacing them with a properly modelled, governed Power BI workspace — and making sure it is adopted, not just delivered.</p><h2>What you will be doing</h2><ul><li>Audit the existing reporting estate and agree a single source of truth with the commercial team.</li><li>Model the semantic layer in Power BI with reusable measures and clear naming.</li><li>Build role-level security so regional managers see only their own data.</li><li>Run two enablement sessions so the team can self-serve after handover.</li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul><li>Demonstrable DAX ability beyond the wizard — you can explain filter context.</li><li>Comfortable writing performant T-SQL against a large transactional database.</li><li>Experience setting up gateways, refresh schedules and workspace governance.</li></ul><h2>How we work</h2><p>Workfoster handles the contract, the milestones and the payment schedule, so you deal with one point of contact instead of chasing invoices. Every engagement starts with a paid, scoped discovery week before the full commitment is confirmed.</p>','Power BI Dashboard Developer','Rebuild a sprawling set of legacy reports into one governed Power BI workspace the whole commercial team can trust.','publish','closed','closed','','power-bi-dashboard-developer','','','2026-09-13 07:19:41','2026-09-13 01:49:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/power-bi-dashboard-developer/',-1,'job_listing','',0),(173,1,'2026-09-10 07:19:41','2026-09-10 01:49:41','<p>Bluewren produces the kind of B2B content that gets shared internally at the companies it is written for. That standard comes from research: every piece starts with a subject-matter interview, and every claim is sourced.</p><h2>What you will be doing</h2><ul><li>Produce two to four long-form pieces a month, typically 1,800–2,500 words.</li><li>Run 30-minute interviews with practitioners and turn them into a defensible narrative.</li><li>Work to a documented style guide and take structural edits without ego.</li><li>Build a primary-source list for every article.</li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul><li>A portfolio of B2B long-form work you personally researched and wrote.</li><li>Ability to get technical detail right in a domain you did not start in.</li><li>Reliable turnaround — the calendar is published a month ahead.</li></ul><h3>Nice to have</h3><ul><li>Background in developer tooling, fintech or logistics.</li></ul><h2>How we work</h2><p>Workfoster handles the contract, the milestones and the payment schedule, so you deal with one point of contact instead of chasing invoices. Every engagement starts with a paid, scoped discovery week before the full commitment is confirmed.</p>','B2B SaaS Content Writer','Write deeply researched long-form pieces for developer-tooling and fintech clients — interviews, not AI paraphrase.','publish','closed','closed','','b2b-saas-content-writer','','','2026-09-10 07:19:41','2026-09-10 01:49:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/b2b-saas-content-writer/',-1,'job_listing','',0),(174,1,'2026-09-07 07:19:41','2026-09-07 01:49:41','<p>Corvid ships an infrastructure API with excellent engineering and patchy documentation. The brief is to establish a docs-as-code practice the engineers will actually keep up with once the engagement ends.</p><h2>What you will be doing</h2><ul><li>Restructure the existing content into a task-based information architecture.</li><li>Own the OpenAPI descriptions and keep the reference generated, not hand-written.</li><li>Set up review workflows so docs changes ship in the same pull request as the code.</li><li>Write the contribution guide that keeps the practice alive after handover.</li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul><li>Proven technical writing for a developer audience.</li><li>Fluent with Git, Markdown and a static site generator.</li><li>Able to read code well enough to check an example actually runs.</li></ul><h2>How we work</h2><p>Workfoster handles the contract, the milestones and the payment schedule, so you deal with one point of contact instead of chasing invoices. Every engagement starts with a paid, scoped discovery week before the full commitment is confirmed.</p>','Technical Documentation Specialist','Take a developer platform\'s docs from scattered README files to a versioned, reviewable docs-as-code site.','publish','closed','closed','','technical-documentation-specialist','','','2026-09-07 07:19:41','2026-09-07 01:49:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/technical-documentation-specialist/',3,'job_listing','',0),(175,1,'2026-09-04 07:19:41','2026-09-04 01:49:41','<p>Harbourline manages a portfolio of mid-market operating companies. This role sits in the central FP&A function and covers the full planning calendar for four of them.</p><h2>What you will be doing</h2><ul><li>Own the annual budget and the rolling 13-week cash forecast for four portfolio companies.</li><li>Produce monthly variance analysis with commentary the CFO can take to the board unedited.</li><li>Build and maintain the three-statement models behind each entity.</li><li>Support due diligence on one bolt-on acquisition during the engagement.</li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul><li>CA, CFA or equivalent, with four or more years in FP&A or transaction services.</li><li>Genuinely strong Excel — modelling from a blank sheet, not editing templates.</li><li>Working knowledge of IFRS and Ind AS.</li></ul><h2>How we work</h2><p>Workfoster handles the contract, the milestones and the payment schedule, so you deal with one point of contact instead of chasing invoices. Every engagement starts with a paid, scoped discovery week before the full commitment is confirmed.</p>','Financial Analyst — FP&A','Run the planning cycle for a mid-market portfolio: budgets, rolling forecasts and the board pack that goes with them.','publish','closed','closed','','financial-analyst-fpa','','','2026-09-04 07:19:41','2026-09-04 01:49:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/financial-analyst-fpa/',-1,'job_listing','',0),(176,1,'2026-09-01 07:19:41','2026-09-01 01:49:41','<p>Sona & Partners looks after the finance function for small businesses that do not need a full-time accountant. You would take a portfolio of around twelve clients, roughly twenty hours a week.</p><h2>What you will be doing</h2><ul><li>Maintain day-to-day books in Tally and Zoho Books across the client portfolio.</li><li>Prepare and file GSTR-1 and GSTR-3B, and reconcile against GSTR-2B every month.</li><li>Handle TDS computation, payment and quarterly returns.</li><li>Flag anything that looks like a compliance risk before it becomes one.</li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul><li>Two or more years of hands-on Indian bookkeeping and statutory filing.</li><li>Confident in Tally Prime; Zoho Books experience is a plus.</li><li>Organised enough to run twelve clients without dropping a deadline.</li></ul><h2>How we work</h2><p>Workfoster handles the contract, the milestones and the payment schedule, so you deal with one point of contact instead of chasing invoices. Every engagement starts with a paid, scoped discovery week before the full commitment is confirmed.</p>','Bookkeeping & GST Compliance','Keep the books clean and the filings on time for a portfolio of twelve small businesses.','publish','closed','closed','','bookkeeping-gst-compliance','','','2026-09-01 07:19:41','2026-09-01 01:49:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/bookkeeping-gst-compliance/',5,'job_listing','',0),(177,1,'2026-08-29 07:19:41','2026-08-29 01:49:41','<p>Meridian builds remote patient monitoring software used on hospital wards. The clinician interface has grown organically for three years and now needs a designer who takes safety-critical UI seriously.</p><h2>What you will be doing</h2><ul><li>Run discovery with ward staff — observation sessions, not just interviews.</li><li>Rebuild the alerting and triage flows around how clinicians actually triage.</li><li>Extend the existing Figma design system rather than starting a parallel one.</li><li>Hold the line on WCAG 2.2 AA; this software is used on shift, on bad screens, at 3am.</li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul><li>Five or more years in product design with shipped, complex B2B work.</li><li>Evidence of designing for accessibility as a constraint, not a checklist.</li><li>Comfortable working directly with engineers in a shared component language.</li></ul><h3>Nice to have</h3><ul><li>Previous healthcare, clinical or other regulated-domain experience.</li></ul><h2>How we work</h2><p>Workfoster handles the contract, the milestones and the payment schedule, so you deal with one point of contact instead of chasing invoices. Every engagement starts with a paid, scoped discovery week before the full commitment is confirmed.</p>','Product Designer (UI/UX)','Design the clinician-facing side of a patient monitoring platform where a misread number has real consequences.','publish','closed','closed','','product-designer-ui-ux','','','2026-08-29 07:19:41','2026-08-29 01:49:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/product-designer-ui-ux/',-1,'job_listing','',0),(178,1,'2026-08-26 07:19:41','2026-08-26 01:49:41','<p>Fernlight is replatforming a publisher that does eight million pageviews a month. WordPress stays as the editorial back end; the front end moves to Next.js. The hard part is keeping the editors happy.</p><h2>What you will be doing</h2><ul><li>Model the content in custom post types and ACF field groups that map cleanly to the front end.</li><li>Extend the REST API with the endpoints the front end needs, with proper caching headers.</li><li>Keep preview working — editors will not accept a workflow where they cannot see drafts.</li><li>Write the migration scripts for eleven years of archive content.</li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul><li>Deep WordPress knowledge: hooks, the query, custom post types, capability checks.</li><li>Modern PHP (7.4+) and comfort writing tested, reviewable code.</li><li>Practical experience with a headless front end, ideally Next.js.</li></ul><h2>How we work</h2><p>Workfoster handles the contract, the milestones and the payment schedule, so you deal with one point of contact instead of chasing invoices. Every engagement starts with a paid, scoped discovery week before the full commitment is confirmed.</p>','WordPress Engineer — Headless Build','Move a high-traffic publisher onto a headless WordPress back end without breaking the editorial workflow.','publish','closed','closed','','wordpress-engineer-headless-build','','','2026-08-26 07:19:41','2026-08-26 01:49:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/wordpress-engineer-headless-build/',-1,'job_listing','',0),(179,1,'2026-08-23 07:19:41','2026-08-23 01:49:41','<p>Trailhead runs middle-mile logistics across South India. Their dispatch platform is Laravel and Vue, it handles around three thousand consignments a day, and the team is growing from four engineers to six.</p><h2>What you will be doing</h2><ul><li>Ship features across the stack — Laravel APIs through to Vue components.</li><li>Take ownership of the route optimisation service and its queue workers.</li><li>Improve the test suite; current coverage is honest but thin.</li><li>Take part in the on-call rotation, one week in four.</li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul><li>Three or more years with Laravel in production, including queues and Eloquent at scale.</li><li>Solid Vue.js and an eye for what belongs in the front end versus the API.</li><li>MySQL query tuning — you can read an EXPLAIN plan.</li></ul><h2>How we work</h2><p>Workfoster handles the contract, the milestones and the payment schedule, so you deal with one point of contact instead of chasing invoices. Every engagement starts with a paid, scoped discovery week before the full commitment is confirmed.</p>','Full-Stack Laravel Developer','Build the dispatch and tracking platform that moves three thousand consignments a day.','publish','closed','closed','','full-stack-laravel-developer','','','2026-08-23 07:19:41','2026-08-23 01:49:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/full-stack-laravel-developer/',8,'job_listing','',0),(180,1,'2026-08-20 07:19:41','2026-08-20 01:49:41','<p>Orchard Grove sells direct-to-consumer home goods. Paid acquisition works, but blended CAC has been flat for two quarters and nobody currently owns the whole funnel.</p><h2>What you will be doing</h2><ul><li>Own Google and Meta spend end to end, roughly ₹40 lakh a month.</li><li>Rebuild the measurement setup in GA4 and server-side tagging so the numbers are trustworthy.</li><li>Run a structured landing-page testing programme, not ad-hoc tweaks.</li><li>Report weekly on contribution margin, not just ROAS.</li></ul><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul><li>Three or more years running significant paid budgets yourself.</li><li>Real GA4 and conversion-tracking depth — enough to debug attribution gaps.</li><li>A track record of CRO work with documented results.</li></ul><h2>How we work</h2><p>Workfoster handles the contract, the milestones and the payment schedule, so you deal with one point of contact instead of chasing invoices. Every engagement starts with a paid, scoped discovery week before the full commitment is confirmed.</p>','Performance Marketing Specialist','Own paid acquisition for a D2C brand at the point where blended CAC has stopped improving.','publish','closed','closed','','performance-marketing-specialist','','','2026-08-20 07:19:41','2026-08-20 01:49:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/workfoster/careers/performance-marketing-specialist/',9,'job_listing','',0);
